  "text": {
    "intro": "The lighthouses along the Saltmarsh coast share a single relief keeper roster, and the logbooks have become a scholarly mess.\nFour keepers are involved. Determine each keeper's day and chore.\n- **Keeper**: Clementine, Emmerich, Perpetua and Lucian.\n- **Day** (listed from earlier to later): Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday.\n- **Logged chore**: rewiring the beacon, regrinding the lens, splicing the hoist rope and overhauling the foghorn.\nEvery keeper has a different day and chore, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
    "clues": [
      "The keeper who logs splicing the hoist rope works on Monday. Lucian logs splicing the hoist rope.",
      "The keeper who logs overhauling the foghorn and Thursday are exactly one day apart in day order, in one direction or the other. Clementine does not work on Thursday.",
      "The keeper who logs regrinding the lens is exactly one day earlier than Emmerich, with no day in between."
    ]
